1 NAME Hannibal /de Stockfleth/
2 GIVN Hannibal
2 SURN de Stockfleth
2 _MARNM de Stockfleth
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 4 NOV 1733
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bragernes
