2 NOTE Martin Hapnes and Birgitta Maria Hapnes are probably the two pictured on the left. As to the other three in the picture, it is unclear which they are of the other children of Johanne Margrethe Magnus's second marriage, to Svend Jo
3 CONC rgensen Hapnes. (Johanne's first marriage was on 15 July 1805 to Andreas Baade, Birgitte von Krogh's husband's brother. It was a double wedding with Birgitte and Knud Christian Baade.) Johanne and Svend's eight children are: (1) B
3 CONC irgitta Maria Elisabeth, b. 15 Feb 1843; (2) Jorgen, b. 18 Feb 1845; (3) Knud Christian, b. 8 Sep 1847; (4) Soren de Fine, b. 27 Feb 1850; (5) Martin, b. 7 Sep 1852; (6) Berge, b 10 Apr 1855; (7) Inger Johanna, b. 8 Jan 1858; (8) 
3 CONC Marie Kristine, b. 25 Aug 1860. 
