1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jenny Ebbing Skavlan (born 3 June 1986) is a Norwegian model, actress, television presenter, and author. She started her career by appearing in a television commercial for Pizza Grandiosa in 2007.[3] She has since 
2 CONC appeared in such films as Fatso, Dead Snow, Børning, and Tomme Tønner.[4] In 2008 Skavlan participated as a celebrity dancer on Skal vi danse? on Norway's TV2.[5] In 2012 she wrote a book, Sy om, about her passion for sewing.[6]
