2 CONT '''Adrianus van Bergen * Utrecht, Nederland c. 1836 s.v. Leendert a. 1860 per "Agatha Maria" vanaf Amsterdam, onderwyser deur dr. W Robertson gewerf, sterf Pretoria 6/8/1894.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT *x Wilhelmina Dorothea Wichelhauzen, 20/6/1860.
2 CONT *xx Maria Cornelia de Groot
2 CONT *xxx Elizabeth Maria Colyn (geb. de Villiers), 1883 Bloemhof. SA families Stamboeke 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a descendant of the Elsevier / De Haro families, with links to several European royal families: Eerw. Adrianus VAN BERGEN, SV/PROG 2 
