1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Family record: "Ons sesde kind, een dogtertje, is geboren op Kleintoren in de Hantam distrik, Colesberg , 9.3.1869’s avonds om 10 ½ ure en gedoopt 5 April door dr. D Postma op Springfontein genaamd Engelina Wilhelm
2 CONC ina"
2 CONT
2 CONT ==LET WEL - PLEASE NOTE==
2 CONT *'''Geen middelnaam word aangedui op haar ma se sterfkennis of haar eie sterfkennis, testament en boedel nie.  Middelnaam "Wilhelmina" alleenlik aangedui op haar man se sterfkennis.'''  
2 CONT *'''No middle name indicated on her mother's death notice or her own death notice, last will & testament and estate.  Middle name "Wilhelmina" only indicated on her husband's death notice.'''  
2 CONT *'''Ouderdom by haar sterfte aangedui as 39 jaar en 10 maande op 16 Januarie 1909, dus gebore c.03/1869.  Tot dusver geen doop dokument gevind.'''
2 CONT *'''Age at death indicated as 39 years and 10 months on 16 January 1909, so born in c.03/1969.  As yet no baptism record has been found.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE that her daughter is also given the name "Wilhelmina'
2 CONT
